WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:04.067
-Guys, before we go on, I'd like
to take a moment to thank

00:00:04.067 --> 00:00:05.667
some of our sponsors
for "Tonight Show."

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:08.167
They don't always get to fit in
the commercial breaks,

00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:09.901
and we want to make sure
that we mention all of them.

00:00:09.901 --> 00:00:12.801
So it's time for "Tonight Show
Sponsors." Here we go.

00:00:12.801 --> 00:00:15.701
-♪ Tonight Show Sponsors ♪

00:00:15.701 --> 00:00:19.801
♪ Tonight Show Sponsors ♪

00:00:19.801 --> 00:00:21.400
-Stella Artois --

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.534
Sounds classy,
even when you're slurring it.

00:00:23.534 --> 00:00:26.334
[ Applause ]

00:00:26.334 --> 00:00:30.200
Turbotax, the official software
of waiting till April 14th.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:32.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:32.467 --> 00:00:34.901
Cold Stone Creamery --
Look, man, we're already

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:36.634
mashing up Snickers
on a marble slab for you.

00:00:36.634 --> 00:00:40.133
Don't make us sing, too.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:40.133 --> 00:00:41.767
Aveeno Hand Lotion --

00:00:41.767 --> 00:00:44.267
Have fun not being able to turn
a doorknob for an hour.

00:00:44.267 --> 00:00:48.300
[ Laughter and applause ]
Wow.

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:50.734
Bass Pro Shops --
heaven on Earth for guys

00:00:50.734 --> 00:00:52.801
who wear sunglasses
on the back of their heads.

00:00:52.801 --> 00:00:55.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:55.934 --> 00:00:57.200
Sleep Number --

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:59.300
So you have trouble
sleeping with your spouse?

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:01.501
Yeah, let's pretend the mattress
is the problem.

00:01:01.501 --> 00:01:05.400
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:07.000
Yoplait -- you'll love us

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.667
if you're over 60 or under 5,
no in-between.

00:01:09.667 --> 00:01:13.234
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.234 --> 00:01:14.901
Bloomingdale's -- hope you like

00:01:14.901 --> 00:01:17.033
taking six escalators
to buy a belt.

00:01:17.033 --> 00:01:20.801
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.801 --> 00:01:23.334
Hooters -- Wait, we haven't
been canceled yet?

00:01:23.334 --> 00:01:27.000
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.567
Canada Dry --
Sprite for grandmas.

00:01:29.567 --> 00:01:30.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.934 --> 00:01:33.267
And finally,
Dick's Sporting Goods --

00:01:33.267 --> 00:01:35.167
Sure, we could have named it
literally anything else,

00:01:35.167 --> 00:01:37.334
but here we are.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:37.334 --> 00:01:39.133
That's all for
"Tonight Show Sponsors."

